## Required Read Order

1. Read [`../AGENTS.md`](../AGENTS.md) for non-negotiable project rules.
2. Read [`../TODO.md`](../TODO.md) for approved and ordered work.
3. Read [`work/INDEX.md`](work/INDEX.md) for the matching plan ID, status, and evidence.
